LICENSE STATUS — PRE-RELEASE FRAMEWORK

The project plan proposes Apache-2.0 for the DocSync source code. The team has not
yet confirmed ownership and third-party redistribution obligations. No blanket
license is granted by this placeholder. Replace this file with the approved full
license text before public release, and set the pyproject license metadata then.

The original planning document, competition attachments and personal declaration
forms are separate materials and are not covered by a future source-code license.
Third-party dependencies remain subject to their own licenses.
